(28, 13, 4, 3, 'Lab Report Clarification', 'Hello Doctor, I received my lipid profile report on the portal. Cholesterol is 210 mg/dL. Is this fine?', 0, '2025-03-29 14:00:00'),
(29, 14, 5, 4, 'Post Consultation Query', 'Thank you for the consultation yesterday. The knee pain has lessened significantly after the first dose.', 0, '2025-03-31 15:00:00'),
(30, 15, 6, 5, 'Rescheduling Appointment', 'Dear Reception, I need to reschedule my Friday appointment to next Monday morning if a slot is open.', 0, '2025-04-02 16:00:00');
